    {
      "id": "claim_dec9e75465014680875640e42b63a6af",
      "statement": "`public/sandbox.html`, `public/sandbox.js`, and `public/sandbox-worker.js` are copied verbatim (un-bundled, un-hashed) into the deploy root by Vite, and the runner/relay address them by fixed relative paths (`./sandbox.html` in `runner.ts`, `./sandbox-worker.js` via `new Worker(...)` in `sandbox.js`). Their filenames are part of the runtime contract and must not be changed without updating those references.",
