      "statement": "`public/tools.jar` (~18 MB, OpenJDK 8, GPLv2 + Classpath Exception) is shipped as a static asset in `public/` and copied into `dist/` by Vite. It is the in-browser `javac` compiler, put on the classpath (`/app/tools.jar:/files/`) by `sandbox-worker.js` when invoking `com.sun.tools.javac.Main`. Bundling it is NOT self-hosting CheerpJ — it is a separate file under a separate, GPL-compatible license.",
