    {
      "id": "claim_56039d83545948f3a4cd089d5b7c1adc",
      "statement": "CheerpJ's free Community License covers public, non-commercial, open-source, publicly-accessible projects and grants unlimited use of CheerpJ loaded from `cjrtnc.leaningtech.com` — exactly this project's deployment shape. It does NOT permit self-hosting or redistributing the CheerpJ runtime; commercial use or self-hosting/offline execution requires a Commercial License instead.",
